#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Jy het nie toestemming vir die toestel van daardie kluster nie."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Naam: 'n ander kluster gebruik reeds hierdie naam."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Die kluster is nie gestoor nie: dit is deur iemand anders verander vandat die vorm oopgemaak is, of die skryfbewerking het misluk. Maak dit weer oop en herhaal die verandering."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Die kluster is gestoor."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Die klusterstaat is nie verander nie: die skryfbewerking het misluk. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Die kluster en sy gekaste momentopname is geskrap. Sy toestel en grafieke is behou. Die skeduleerder is nie gekontak nie."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Die toestel en sy grafieke is geskep."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Die toestel is nie geskep nie: die kluster het reeds 'n toestel, dit is deur iemand anders verander vandat die bladsy oopgemaak is, of Cacti het dit geweier. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Die kluster is aan die toestel gekoppel."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Die kluster is nie gekoppel nie: die toestel bestaan nie, word nie vir jou toegelaat nie, dra reeds 'n ander kluster, of die kluster is deur iemand anders verander vandat die bladsy oopgemaak is."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Ontbrekende grafieke is bygevoeg."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Geen grafieke is bygevoeg nie: die kluster het geen toestel nie, of sy toestel bestaan nie meer nie."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Die kluster is nie ontkoppel nie: dit is deur iemand anders verander vandat die bladsy oopgemaak is."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Die kluster is ontkoppel. Die toestel en sy grafieke is behou."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Die partisies is vanuit die momentopname herindekseer."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Die partisies is nie herindekseer nie: die toestel is gedeaktiveer of onbereikbaar, dus het Cacti sy datanavraag oorgeslaan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Die partisies is nie herindekseer nie: Cacti kon nie die datanavraag uitvoer nie. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Die partisies is nie herindekseer nie: die HPC Scheduler-datanavraag is nie geïnstalleer nie. Installeer die sjablone vanaf die gesondheidsbladsy."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Die partisies is nie herindekseer nie: die kluster het geen toestel nie, of sy toestel bestaan nie meer nie."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Die HPC Scheduler-sjablone is geïnstalleer."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Die sjablone is nie geïnstalleer nie: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Moniteringsaansig"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Waarnemings kon nie gelees word nie. Vra 'n administrateur om die inproplogboek na te gaan."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Ondersoek hangende redefamilies en momentopname-varsheid op die oorsig. Eskaleer geloofsbriewe, klusterkoppelings en instandhoudingsbeleid na 'n administrateur."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Naam: gebruik 1 tot 64 letters, syfers, punte, koppeltekens of onderstrepe, beginnende met 'n letter of syfer."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: kies een van die gelyste pollers."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Insamelingsinterval: voer heel sekondes van %d tot %d in."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Vervoer: kies een van die gelyste vervoermetodes."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: voer 'n absolute pad in, of laat dit leeg om die poller se verstekwaarde te gebruik."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd-URL: hierdie gasheer en poort is nie op die slurmrestd-gasheerlys in Opstelling nie."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd-URL: voer 'n https:// URL sonder gebruikersnaam, navraag of fragment in; gewone http:// word slegs vir 'n teruglusadres aanvaar."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "slurmrestd-gebruiker: gebruik hoogstens 64 letters, syfers, punte, koppeltekens of onderstrepe, of laat dit leeg vir 'n gebruikertoken."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Tokenlêer: voer die absolute pad van die tokenlêer op die poller in. Die token self word nooit hier ingevoer nie."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Tokenlêer: geen tokenlêergidse is nog gestel nie. Vra 'n Cacti-administrateur om dit onder Opstelling, HPC Scheduler te stel."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Tokenlêer: die lêer moet binne een van die tokenlêergidse wees wat in Opstelling gestel is (%s)."

