#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Data-ontleder"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Slurm-data-ontleder vir die kliëntopdragte. Kies een wat saam met die vrystelling van elke kluster wat deur kliëntopdragte gelees word, beskikbaar is: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11 en 26.05 en word in 27.05 verwyder; v0.0.44 vereis 25.11 of later; v0.0.45 vereis 26.05 of later. Die gesondheidsbladsy waarsku wanneer 'n kluster 'n vrystelling daarsonder rapporteer. Klusters wat deur slurmrestd gelees word, ignoreer hierdie opstelling: hulle gebruik die nuutste hiervan wat die daemon bedien, en die gesondheidsbladsy wys watter een."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Absolute pad na squeue op elke poller wat 'n kluster deur kliëntopdragte lees. Die inprop voer dit slegs as squeue --all --json met die data-ontleder hierbo uit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Absolute pad na scontrol. Die inprop voer slegs scontrol --json show node, show partition en show reservation uit; nooit update, reconfigure of token nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Absolute pad na sshare, slegs gebruik vir klusters wat regverdige deel insamel."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Limiete"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Roep-tyduit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een skeduleerderroep mag neem voordat dit gestop word en sy afdeling as misluk aangeteken word. 'n Roep hardloop ook nooit verby die leser se tydbegroting nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Maksimum antwoordgrootte"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB wat een skeduleerderroep mag terugstuur. 'n Groter antwoord word weggegooi en sy afdeling as misluk aangeteken. Dekodering benodig ongeveer 12 keer die antwoordgrootte, dus gebruik die leser hoogstens (Insamelingsgeheue - 64) / 12 MiB en die gesondheidsbladsy waarsku wanneer hierdie waarde groter is."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Insamelingsgeheue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB PHP-geheue waarna elke insamelingslopie sy limiet verhoog (dit verlaag dit nooit nie). Die verstekwaarde van 1024 pas antwoorde tot 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Absolute pad na prlimit (util-linux), gebruik om die adresruimte van elke kliëntopdrag te beperk. Laat leeg om opdragte sonder 'n geheuelimiet uit te voer; die gesondheidsbladsy waarsku dan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Opdraggeheuelimiet"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB adresruimte wat elke kliëntopdrag deur prlimit mag gebruik."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "slurmrestd-geloofsbriewe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Token-lêergidse"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Absolute gidse op die pollers wat slurmrestd-tokenlêers mag bevat, geskei deur kommas of spasies. 'n Kluster kan slegs 'n tokenlêer binne een van hulle noem wat deur die poller-gebruiker besit word en sonder 'n simboliese skakel bereik word. Hou elke gids slegs skryfbaar vir root en die poller-gebruiker. Leeg beteken geen kluster kan slurmrestd gebruik nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "slurmrestd-gashere"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Opsioneel. Die slurmrestd-gashere wat 'n kluster mag noem, as gasheer of gasheer:poort, geskei deur kommas of spasies. 'n Inskrywing sonder 'n poort laat enige poort op daardie gasheer toe. Leeg laat enige gasheer toe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Sekondes voordat 'n token verval wanneer die gesondheidsbladsy begin waarsku, indien die token 'n vervaltyd dra."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Token-vervalwaarskuwing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Wanneer dit gemerk is, behou die verwydering van die inprop sy klusters en kiekies. Maak dit skoon sodat die verwydering hulle laat vaar; voer die klusters eers uit vanaf HPC Clusters. Die inprop skep geen Cacti-toestelle of Maint-skedules in hierdie vrystelling nie, en die skeduleerder word in elk geval nooit gekontak nie."

